.vscode/
node_modules/
*.log

# ── Nothing below here may ever be committed ────────────────────────────
# Cloudflare Pages serves this repo's ROOT as the public website, so every
# committed file is a public URL. Until v67 the admin dashboard, the edge
# function source, the full schema with its RLS policies and an old session
# export full of real player names were all reachable on mabyo.pages.dev by
# anyone who guessed the path. No keys were in them, but it was a map of the
# access-control design handed out for free.
#
# The admin tool now lives in ../Badminton Admin, outside this repo. These
# patterns stop it, or anything like it, walking back in.
Badminton Admin/
admin.html
*.sql
edge-function-*.ts
ACCESS_BLUEPRINT.md
Badminton-Rotation.json

# Screenshots and scratch files dropped in the folder while working
*.png
!icon.png

# Test scratch: dev/_app.js is index.html's script extracted for the headless
# harness, regenerated by dev/test-mix.js. Committing it would let a stale
# copy drift away from the file it was taken from.
dev/_*.js
